WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:08.538
The cat smacked Feather with its paws.

2
00:00:08.539 --> 00:00:15.155
Whap! Whap!

3
00:00:15.156 --> 00:00:22.966
Feather flew all over the room.

4
00:00:22.967 --> 00:00:27.025
Then the cat's sharp claws popped out!

5
00:00:27.026 --> 00:00:32.253
"Ah-choo!" A loud sneeze startled the cat.

6
00:00:32.254 --> 00:00:36.762
Bumble jumped from a box, covered with spots.

7
00:00:36.763 --> 00:00:44.129
The cat hissed.

8
00:00:44.130 --> 00:00:50.273
"Scat, Cat!" Bumble yelled. "Ah-ah-ah . . ."

9
00:00:50.274 --> 00:00:55.581
Another giant sneeze burst from Bumble.

10
00:00:55.582 --> 00:01:00.919
The cat jumped back and ran off!

11
00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:08.869
The others quickly turned back into fairies.

12
00:01:08.870 --> 00:01:11.670
Bumble grinned as he scratched a spot.

13
00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:14.942
"There were some silver coins in the box.

14
00:01:14.943 --> 00:01:22.160
But I found a wishbit." He held up a bookmark.

15
00:01:22.161 --> 00:01:27.337
"I hope Blinx can help us with the wish."

16
00:01:27.338 --> 00:01:30.991
The fairies flew to the Wish Factory.

17
00:01:30.992 --> 00:01:33.558
The factory looked dark.

18
00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:38.424
"Uh-oh," Hob said. "Where's Blinx?"

19
00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:43.119
Blinx threw open the door. "Right here.

20
00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:45.734
But I'm about to go home."

21
00:01:45.735 --> 00:01:52.892
Bumble bit his lip. "A girl wished for a friend.

22
00:01:52.893 --> 00:02:00.492
Can you help?" Blinx

23
00:02:00.493 --> 00:02:07.469
sighed and took the bookmark. A

24
00:02:07.470 --> 00:02:10.738
minute later he was back. "Return

25
00:02:10.739 --> 00:02:17.375
this bookmark to Sally." Then—

26
00:02:17.376 --> 00:02:28.002
boom! He shut the door.

27
00:02:28.003 --> 00:02:33.747
The next day the fairies flew back to Sally's yard.

28
00:02:33.748 --> 00:02:38.580
Bumble was holding the bookmark. "I hope this works."

29
00:02:38.581 --> 00:02:44.516
Whoosh! A strong wind suddenly blew.

30
00:02:44.517 --> 00:02:47.695
"The bookmark!" Bumble cried.

31
00:02:47.696 --> 00:02:51.439
It blew out of his hand and past Sally.

32
00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:55.605
"My bookmark!" she cried, running after it.

33
00:02:55.606 --> 00:02:58.581
The fairies flew after Sally.

34
00:02:58.582 --> 00:03:02.404
They followed her out of the yard.

35
00:03:02.405 --> 00:03:08.807
Then they flew into another backyard.

36
00:03:08.808 --> 00:03:14.342
"A unicorn bookmark!" someone cried.

37
00:03:14.343 --> 00:03:19.799
Sally ran toward a little girl. "That's my bookmark!

38
00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.991
It blew away."

39
00:03:21.992 --> 00:03:27.283
The girl handed it to Sally. "I love unicorns too!

40
00:03:27.284 --> 00:03:31.462
Want to play with me?"

41
00:03:31.463 --> 00:03:37.505
Hob sighed happily. "Best friends forever!"

42
00:03:37.506 --> 00:03:42.187
Sprite nodded. "Great job, Bumble.

43
00:03:42.188 --> 00:03:45.729
You were fast—and brave!"

44
00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:58.354
Bumble blushed. "And I didn't even break anything!"

